{# goal: Emit the Phase 0 condensation-triage output shapes for the doc-update skill: the triage table (CORE / FOLD / DELETE) and the fold plan. Every FOLD needs a successor; "none" is only valid for DELETE rows whose content is fully obsolete. Feeds the fewer-than-85-document cap check (working target 75 — operator ruling 2026-10-07, DOCUMENTATION_STANDARDS.md §3). The Phase 6 gate results are reported by the skill's own convergence form, not by this template — gate data does not exist at Phase 0 render time. #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    date: string
    count_before: number
    count_after: number
    triage_rows: array
    fold_rows: array
  output:
    triage_table: string
    fold_plan: string
---
## Condensation triage (`triage_table`) — {{ date }}

Tree count before: {{ count_before }} (cap: < 85, working target 75)
Tree count after (projected): {{ count_after }}

| Path | Role (CORE / FOLD / DELETE) | Reason | Successor |
|------|------------------------------|--------|-----------|
{%- for row in triage_rows %}
| {{ row.path }} | {{ row.role }} | {{ row.reason }} | {{ row.successor_or_none }} |
{%- endfor %}

## Fold plan (`fold_plan` — FOLD rows only)

For each FOLD: name the target section in the successor doc, the content
being carried forward, and the links that must be repointed.

| Source | Successor section | Content carried | Links to repoint |
|--------|-------------------|-----------------|------------------|
{%- for row in fold_rows %}
| {{ row.source }} | {{ row.section }} | {{ row.content }} | {{ row.links }} |
{%- endfor %}
